rotamer_names.props
-------------------

Copied verbatim from cctbx_project/mmtbx/rotamer/rotamer_names.props
(https://github.com/cctbx/cctbx_project, as shipped in cctbx-base 2025.11). It defines the
chi-angle boxes that name each rotamer (`RotamerID.identify`).

